  "docTitle": "Online Auction - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design an eBay-style online auction: listing and search, consistent bid acceptance under heavy concurrency (conditional updates or per-auction serialisation), proxy bidding, real-time bid updates, closing exactly on time, anti-sniping, winner payment, and consistency vs availability.",
  "hero": {
    "tag": "header",
    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Meta</span><span class=\"chip company\">Razorpay</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Online Auction (eBay-style Bidding)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Sellers list items, bidders search and bid, and in the last ten seconds a thousand people press \"Bid\" at once. Design the system that accepts exactly the right bids in the right order, shows everyone the new price within a second, closes the auction at the exact end time, and charges exactly one winner.</p>\n      "
